1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
Good morning, oh sorry, it's gone 12,

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:09,600
I'll start again, good afternoon, Kingswell Sports Club, how can I help you?

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,360
Oh, good afternoon. I was wondering

4
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:15,800
if you could give me some information about membership and facilities.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,250
Of course. What would you like to know?

6
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,800
Do you have tennis courts, for example?

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:25,470
No, I'm afraid we don't. We're primarily a golf club.

8
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:28,890
What about football? I heard you had a team.

9
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:34,470
No, I'm sorry. Perhaps you're thinking about Fresham Sports Centre.

10
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:38,940
Oh, right. I know it. I've played badminton there.

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:44,360
Have you? They've got a lot of facilities we don't have and vice versa

12
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,040
We do have a keep-fit studio,

13
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,960
which is very popular with members

14
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,720
and then as well as that there's swimming, of course.

15
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,220
That's good. I like to swim every day.

16
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,820
We have a range of classes too.

17
00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:00,320
Do you have judo classes? I'm keen to learn.

18
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:03,330
Well, at the moment we offer kick-boxing.

19
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:07,600
We're planning to add judo and stretch classes soon

20
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:11,070
We're currently running a range of yoga classes, too.

21
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:16,520
What about relaxing after exercise? I assume you have a restaurant or something.

22
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:20,330
At the moment, we've got a salad bar which is very popular.

23
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:24,140
We'll also have a fully-licensed restaurant by the end of the year.

24
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,400
Sounds good!

25
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:30,230
What kind of membership are you interested in?

26
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:34,330
Um I'm not really sure. What are the options?

27
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:37,740
Well, there are three different membership schemes.

28
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:40,050
I see. What's the difference?

29
00:01:40,050 --> 00:01:43,060
Well, the first one's called Gold

30
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:47,209
and you can use all the facilities at any time of the day or week.

31
00:01:47,209 --> 00:01:51,640
You can also join in as many classes as you like for free.

32
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:54,670
That sounds good. Is it very expensive?

33
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:01,414
Well, you pay a £250 joining fee and then it's £450-oh no,

34
00:02:01,414 --> 00:02:05,920
I'm sorry, it's just gone up by £50

35
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:11,530
sorry about that. It's now £500 for the annual subscription fee.

36
00:02:11,530 --> 00:02:15,600
Right, got that. And what's the next type?

37
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:24,679
Well, that's Silver - it's the same as Gold except you have to pay a small fee of £1.00 per lesson for any you do

38
00:02:24,679 --> 00:02:28,310
and you can only use the centre at certain times.

39
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:31,090
I see. So when exactly?

40
00:02:31,090 --> 00:02:36,320
YOU can only use the facilities between 10 am and 4.30 pm.

41
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:40,690
So I couldn't use the pool at 8 in the morning or evening, then?

42
00:02:40,690 --> 00:02:42,030
That's right.

43
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:47,800
OK. And the price for that? Is the joining fee the same as for Gold?

44
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:54,520
Actually, it's slightly less than the £250-it's £225

45
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:55,998
but the annual fee is only £300.

46
00:02:55,998 --> 00:03:00,370
Does that sound more like what you want?

47
00:03:00,370 --> 00:03:03,144
Well, it's still rather more expensive than I thought.

48
00:03:03,144 --> 00:03:07,150
I'm a student here in England and I'm only here for six months.

49
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:11,200
Ah, then the Bronze scheme would probably suit you best.

50
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,620
How is that different?

51
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:16,200
Well, some of the facilities have restricted use.

52
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,910
And do I have to pay for classes?

53
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:22,400
Yes, it's £3 for each class you join.

54
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:25,220
I see. And what are the hours then?

55
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:32,429
Between 10.30 and 3.30 weekdays only and you pay a £50 joining fee.

56
00:03:32,429 --> 00:03:39,140
The annual fee is £180-it works out at £15 a month

57
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,560
so that would be quite a lot cheaper.

58
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:45,160
Oh, that should be all right. I could come in my free periods

59
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:48,310
What do I have to do if I want to join?

60
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:53,020
Well, we book you in for an assessment with an instructor

61
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:55,563
who will show you how to use all the equipment.

62
00:03:55,563 --> 00:03:59,880
If you want to organize a trial session and look around the centre

63
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,470
you'll need to speak to David Kynchley.

64
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,200
Hmm. Could you spell that please?

65
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:26,200
Yes, David K-Y-N-C-H-L-E-Y. I'll give you his direct line number. It's oh-four-five-eight-nine-five-three-double one.

66
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,360
Thanks.

67
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:30,800
Thank you for calling Kingswell Sports Club.
